.SS "void IVT_CAN_Config (void)"

.PP
Configures the IVT-S sensor by sending a sequence of CAN commands\&. Each command must be acknowledged within 2 ms or a retry/failure is triggered\&. 
.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
This routine blocks while waiting for each command’s acknowledgment flag: IVT_commandReceivedFlag must be set before proceeding to the next step\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturn values\fP
.RS 4
\fINone\fP 
.RE
