.SS "void IVT_CAN_Setup (CAN_HandleTypeDef * hcan)"

.PP
Configures FDCAN filters for IVT-S sensor data and starts the controller\&. Sets up individual mask filters to accept only the specific IVT-S CAN IDs for voltage (U1, U2, U3), current, temperature, power, and command acknowledgments\&. Routes all accepted messages to RX FIFO0, enables the RX FIFO0 interrupt, and starts the FDCAN peripheral\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIhfdcan\fP Pointer to the initialized FDCAN handle (e\&.g\&., &hcan1)\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturn values\fP
.RS 4
\fINone\fP 
.RE
.PP

