.SS "void IVT_CAN_Setup_AllMessages (CAN_HandleTypeDef * hcan)"

.PP
Configures FDCAN to receive all CAN messages by setting wildcard filters\&. Installs two mask filters—one for standard IDs (0x000–0x7FF) and one for extended IDs (0x00000000–0x1FFFFFFF)—each with a zero mask so that all IDs pass through\&. Routes all messages into RX FIFO 0, enables the new-message interrupt, and starts the FDCAN peripheral\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIhfdcan\fP Pointer to the initialized FDCAN handle (e\&.g\&., &hcan1)\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturn values\fP
.RS 4
\fINone\fP 
.RE
